  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Environmental Education in Bhutan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">42 C/5 IP2 - amplifying Environmental Education in Bhutan, by reinforcing the capacity of Lamperli Visitors Education &amp; Interpretation Center. Planned activities will include developing and contextualizing modules on climate change education in English and in Dzongkha, which will be used during workshops and learning opportunities on Science-Based Environmental Education for Young People. Given that Bhutan has also developed the Country Initiative on ESD, the project will promote and scale-up Bhutan&#x2019;s efforts towards climate action.</narrative>
  </description>
